{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fc0a3889b887cbca5f450d168f44cac9506c6714fccd28b33984c615f704f3fa","ja":"積み重ねてきたもの","zh":"一路积累下来的东西","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"57cf22efef08df332d99c3f6a719861ed4e1275b723b5c97611997ce0547c320","ja":"すっごくドキドキしちゃった～！\nみんな、お疲れ様！","zh":"心跳得好快～！\n大家辛苦了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0ac8456cf96dd3ba24683414fcdc3a96178d9b16a74e6734f08b4efdd69134dc","ja":"お疲れ様です～。\nエモーショナルなステージでしたね。","zh":"辛苦了～。\n真是一场充满感情的演出呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0f6f14c5ed4ace134d375ea2e05c4ce49d90793721aa9976f1b5ed4660eb8d30","ja":"うん！\nロコロコ、なんかすっごくいい表情してたよ。","zh":"嗯！\nROCOROCO，表情特别好呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"df39394a0ed7467d6bc489d80c0ace3123252a67c2f51b1c55a2e1e2925a1769","ja":"曲が終わった瞬間とか、感動で胸がいっぱい～！って\n感じだったもん！","zh":"歌曲结束的瞬间之类的，心里满是感动～！就是\n那种感觉！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2254351f2c09d25f4951ba3ddabfa6aab014454092f65fd6745dc7406ea04efc","ja":"だって、これまで積み重ねてきたピースが、\n1つのアートに組みあがった気がして……。","zh":"因为至今积累的碎片，\n感觉拼成了1件艺术品……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"0664db828a75456e5b59a6bf95d8f8f96a600498098834addd29baf39e00e7f6","ja":"ロコさんもですか？\nわたしも同じように感じました。","zh":"ROCO先生也是吗？\n我也有同样的感觉。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6345ad449d634652d6e2ddef8cf54e1f6971371742e2f0c243638275abf8e439","ja":"劇場での公演や特別レッスン。\n美術のお勉強や手作りアート……。","zh":"剧场公演与特别课程。\n学习美术和手工艺术……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"665fd9e288b69b68c12ea26a93f9f952b76c8d26a4a0dbc9c218472ce93d5f63","ja":"それが全部、今日のステージに\n繋がってる気がして！","zh":"感觉这一切都\n连接着今天的舞台！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4f29f87b3a9c270e3f5ee0fc9b8efff3bb1a66517851b7a40318cd9e6dd8cce8","ja":"今まで頑張ってきたことが、\n私たちの感性や表現力を育ててくれたのね！","zh":"至今为止努力过的事情，\n培养了我们的感性和表现力呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"00d0f7eb8dc4e46517ce6566195235d1730b5256998f1879b82b41c23495bc3f","ja":"お陰で、あんなに大きな拍手と声援をもらえて。","zh":"多亏了这些，才能获得如此热烈的掌声与欢呼。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"acd4e5ab2640c33de5077b2080b3c8f6441a7933da0fca7c297282deec926755","ja":"静かに見ていたお客さんが、曲が終わった瞬間に\n一変したから、ちょっとビックリしちゃったわ。","zh":"原本安静看着的观众，在曲子结束的瞬间\n突然变了，让我有点吃惊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"3bc414862e5d3648e58a7e87103ded36a7be5507501d9344e9aaf63d7c09fe6d","ja":"わたしは拍手とブラボーって声が聞こえたとき、\n思わずウルってしちゃいました♪","zh":"当我听到掌声和喝彩声的时候，\n不禁感动得落泪了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"10f396f8d94845b6fcf47d0899a548e4f9b1ba3766d664715ad8e64a456b535e","ja":"スタンディングオベーションがもらえるなんて\n夢みたいでしたね！","zh":"能得到起立鼓掌\n简直像做梦一样呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"9a745cb76c40f5e2a66029da80fc05d01acb3f317430a191d1f122ae1552f997","ja":"うん！　あんなに褒められたら、\nもっともっと頑張りたくなってきちゃったよ！","zh":"嗯！被夸得那么厉害，\n我就更想努力了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"617895a6b27425795d3d25f1c40a7d8a341044771f32ce5926fa49168eb2a0e9","ja":"ねえロコロコ、レッスンしに行こ！？","zh":"喂ROCOROCO，去上课吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"89ffec441ff1ae7453a2f46533463755d1c5450eb8c436d1b519bf399c2b1bf4","ja":"え、今からですか！？　今日はもう\nフィニッシュした気分なんですけど……。","zh":"诶，现在开始吗！？　今天已经\n感觉已经结束了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"2fa6d052b4d47dac3cc5dba3633adc40bfb9d9c1dd5924d6ad17221908839024","ja":"大丈夫！　私たちのアートに限界はないよっ！\n特別レッスンの前だって頑張れたんだし！","zh":"没问题！我们的艺术没有极限哦！\n连特别课程之前都努力过来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"836d68503b972c5ad92e6288ce3984c733b2f522ceeb3203a564d46441a854dc","ja":"あ、あの時は無我夢中で……。\n今はもうフィジカルが限界ですから……。","zh":"啊，那时候我完全忘我了……\n现在我的体力已经到极限了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"4f5eb14c788873011d97919932c2eab3862b7d784304fe050ec154edd18bbb63","ja":"それじゃあ、行ってみよ～♪","zh":"那就出发吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_965.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"a6783942aae4a1536bbd79bfc588a606297d01b3e691fd10bcacac3d42b31eb6","ja":"……って聞いてますか、ウミ！？\nひ、引っ張らないでください～！？","zh":"……你听到了吗，海美！？\n别、别拉我～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
